class="px-3">/</span></div><div><span>Vote on Election Day</span></div></div></div><main class="container pb-10 scroll-mt-[5.5rem] md:scroll-mt-[11.375rem] lg:scroll-mt-[8.25rem]" id="main-content" tabindex="-1"><div class="md:grid md:grid-cols-4 md:gap-l lg:gap-l-desktop"><div class="mb-s"><nav aria-label="Sidebar navigation"><div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-0 px-[0.625rem]  py-5 group bg-primary-1 border-b-[5px] border-primary-2 rounded-t gap-2"><div class="h6 mb-0 text-white">Elections &amp; Voting</div><div class="md:hidden flex flex-col justify-center items-center w-[1.125rem] h-[1.125rem] basis-[1.125rem] shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white"><i class="fa-chevron-down fa-solid text-xs"></i></div></div></nav></div><div class="md:col-span-3"><article class=""><div class="border-b-2 border-background-3 mb-5 md:mb-10"><h1 class="mb-s">Vote on Election Day</h1></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse lg:flex-row"><div class="gap-10 flex flex-col w-full "><div><div class=" rich-text"><div class=""><p>On Election Day, you must vote at your assigned polling place. Be sure to look up your polling place in advance — it may have changed since you last voted.</p>
<p>Polling places will be open from 7 a.m. to 8 p.m. on Election Day.</p>
<p><a class="font-bold font-body text-base text-center inline-flex items-center justify-center group py-[0.3125rem] pr-[0.3125rem] pl-3 bg-accent-2 text-white hover:bg-accent-3 rounded-full  button button-primary" tabindex="0" target="_blank" aria-label="External link: Find your polling place" href="https://pollfinder.sos.state.mn.us/"><span>Find your polling place</span><i class="fa-arrow-up-right-from-square fa-solid ml-2 bg-accent-3 text-white group-hover:bg-accent-2 rounded-full w-[1.875rem] h-[1.875rem] text-sm !leading-[1.875rem]"></i></a> <a class="font-bold font-body text-base text-center inline-flex items-center justify-center group py-[0.375rem] px-4 bg-white text-type-1 border border-background-3 hover:bg-primary-2 hover:text-white rounded-full  button button-secondary" tabindex="0" target="_blank" aria-label="External link: View your sample ballot" href="https://www.sos.mn.gov/elections-voting/whats-on-my-ballot/get-a-sample-ballot/"><span>View your sample ballot</span><i class="fa-arrow-up-right-from-square fa-solid ml-2 text-primary-1 group-hover:text-white text-[1.125rem] leading-[1.5rem] align-middle"></i></a><br/>To register on Election Day, you must show <a href="https://www.sos.state.mn.us/elections-voting/register-to-vote/register-on-election-day/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" referrerPolicy="origin-when-cross-origin">proof of identification and residence<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline inline-flex items-center ml-1"><i class="fa-arrow-up-right-from-square fa-solid text-xs -translate-y-0.5" aria-label="(link is external)"></i></span></a>.</p>
<h2>Returning absentee ballots</h2>
<p>On Election Day, the only place you may return your absentee ballot in person is the <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Ramsey+County+Property+Tax,+Records+and+Elections+Services/@44.9359416,-93.090656,15z/data=!4m5!3m4!1s0x0:0xd056d0e1386c8e43!8m2!3d44.9359416!4d-93.090656" target="_blank" rel="noopener" referrerPolicy="origin-when-cross-origin">Ramsey County Elections Office<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline inline-flex items-center ml-1"><i class="fa-arrow-up-right-from-square fa-solid text-xs -translate-y-0.5" aria-label="(link is external)"></i></span></a>. Ballots must be returned by 5 p.m.<br/><br/>Voters cannot return an absentee ballot at a polling place on Election Day.</p>
<p>If you have an unsubmitted absentee ballot, you may vote at your assigned polling place instead. Your absentee ballot will be spoiled (made invalid in the system) and you will be issued a new ballot to cast at the polling place.</p>
</div></div></div><div><div class=""><h2 class="text-background-4 pb-5 mb-5 border-b border-b-background-3">Contact us</h2><div class="grid gap-default lg:grid-cols-3"><div><div class="grid gap-[0.3125rem]"><div class="text-lg font-black">Elections</div><a class="text-base text-accent-2 hover:text-primary-1 underline" href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#6f0a030a0c1b0600011c2f1d0e021c0a160c001a011b16020141080019"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="32575e5751465b5d5c417240535f41574b515d475c464b5f5c1c555d44">[email&#160;protected]</span></a><div class="my-2"><a class="text-base text-accent-2 hover:text-primary-1 underline" href="tel:+16512662171">651-266-2171</a></div><div>Fax: <!-- -->651-266-2177</div></div></div></div><div class="pt-5"><div class="grid gap-default lg:grid-cols-3"><div class="grid gap-2.5"><a class="text-base text-accent-2 hover:text-primary-1 underline" href="/residents/elections-voting/contact-elections">Contact form</a></div><div class="grid gap-2.5"><a class="text-base text-accent-2 hover:text-primary-1 underline" href="/residents/elections-voting">More information</a></div><div class="grid gap-2.5"><a class="text-base text-accent-2 hover:text-primary-1 underline" href="https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/MNRAMSEY/subscriber/topics?qsp=MNRAMSEY_456">E-newsletter</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></article></div></div></main><footer class="bg-primary-1 text-white py-[3.75rem] lg:py-20"><div class="container"><div class="flex justify-center lg:justify-between mb-10 lg:mb-[3.75rem]"><img alt="Ramsey County" loading="lazy" width="676" height="80" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-min max-w-[21.125rem]" style="color:transparent" src="/static/ramsey-logo-white.png"/><button class="hidden lg:flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm group"><span class="group-hover:underline">Back to top</span><div class="text-white group-hover:text-primary-2 rounded-full w-[1.875rem] h-[1.875rem] bg-primary-2 group-hover:bg-white flex justify-cen